public/audio/**  —  original work, CC0 / public domain
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The ambient audio (public/audio/ambient.mp3, .ogg, and the copies under
web/public/audio/) contains no third-party samples or recordings. It is pure
additive synthesis generated in this repository by scripts/generate-ambient.mjs
and is released as CC0 / public domain by its author — more permissive than
MIT, so there is nothing extra for you to do. See public/audio/README.md.


--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled and generated assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

public/textures/*.png, web/public/textures/*.png, docs/assets/*, and the
images under docs/design/handoff-2026-07/assets/ were created for this project
(hand-authored, procedurally generated, or AI-generated placeholders for the
design mockups). They carry no third-party terms and fall under this project's
MIT license.

No model weights, fonts, or CSS frameworks are vendored in this repository.
Image and video generation reference checkpoints by filename only (SDXL, Wan,
LTXV and any LoRAs) and expect them to be supplied on the operator's own
ComfyUI host; those models carry their own licenses, which are between you and
their publishers. Web fonts (Cormorant, Cormorant SC, Spectral — all SIL Open
Font License) are loaded from the Google Fonts CDN at runtime rather than
being bundled here.

Third-party npm dependencies keep their own licenses; see the package.json
files and node_modules/ after install.
